The SCRAM tool file templates in this package are derived from the tool files of
cms-sw/cmsdist (scram-tools.file/tools) and from the resolved tool files of a CMSSW
release, with the CMS-specific paths replaced by the conda prefix.

cms-sw/cmsdist carries no LICENSE file of its own; the CMS software distribution it
belongs to is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE), which is what this
package assumes.
